{"id":"f29bba901d666547","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md","title":"Kleene Normal Form Theorem","display":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene Normal Form Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-kleene-normal-form","aliases":["88-thm-kleene-normal-form"],"display":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene Normal Form Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","[[88-df-partial-recursive]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-minimization-operator]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","[[88-df-tm-run-encoding]]","[[88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-kleene-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-kleene-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-normal-form — Kleene Normal Form Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19695ddba8e7d948\" href=\"?note=19695ddba8e7d948\" title=\"88-df-partial-recursive\">88-df-partial-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9706166a50cc2c4\" href=\"?note=d9706166a50cc2c4\" title=\"88-df-minimization-operator\">88-df-minimization-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b301b626e1a834ac\" href=\"?note=b301b626e1a834ac\" title=\"88-df-tm-run-encoding\">88-df-tm-run-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"94cc6e7e3caa17f9\" href=\"?note=94cc6e7e3caa17f9\" title=\"88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive\">88-fact-kleene-t-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> (partial function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\">\\(T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\\)</span> (Kleene computation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d2dec526682fb65\" href=\"?note=5d2dec526682fb65\" title=\"88-df-kleene-t-predicate\">88-df-kleene-t-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathsf{out}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(U_{\\mathsf{out}}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (primitive-recursive output extractor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b301b626e1a834ac\" href=\"?note=b301b626e1a834ac\" title=\"88-df-tm-run-encoding\">88-df-tm-run-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(U_{\\mathsf{out}})\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(U_{\\mathsf{out}})\\)</span> (primitive-recursive predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\)</span> (arity-indexed partial-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"19695ddba8e7d948\" href=\"?note=19695ddba8e7d948\" title=\"88-df-partial-recursive\">88-df-partial-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e^{(k)})_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (effective program numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> (Kleene equality of partial values, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu t[T_k(e,\\vec x,t)]\">\\(\\mu t[T_k(e,\\vec x,t)]\\)</span> (least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> satisfying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k\">\\(T_k\\)</span>, undefined if none; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"d9706166a50cc2c4\" href=\"?note=d9706166a50cc2c4\" title=\"88-df-minimization-operator\">88-df-minimization-operator</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(U_{\\mathsf{out}})\n\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nf=\\{\\langle\\vec x,U_{\\mathsf{out}}(t)\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land t\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\n\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s&lt;t\\to\\neg T_k(e,\\vec x,s))\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_1(U_{\\mathsf{out}})\n\\land\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PartRec}_k(f)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nf=\\{\\langle\\vec x,U_{\\mathsf{out}}(t)\\rangle:\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land t\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\n\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s&lt;t\\to\\neg T_k(e,\\vec x,s))\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\">\\(T_k(e,\\vec x,t)\\)</span> : 原始递归的Kleene计算谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathsf{out}}\">\\(U_{\\mathsf{out}}\\)</span> : 由规范运行码固定的原始递归输出提取函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu t\">\\(\\mu t\\)</span> : 最小化算子</li>\n<li>任何部分递归函数可用单一<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>算子表示</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-kleene-t-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-t-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"19695ddba8e7d948","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-minimization-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d9706166a50cc2c4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-minimization-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"r